[TITLE: THE BLACKSMITH OF GODDESSES]
[KETH'AR SOLO · VELANTHRA · A LITANY IN FIFTY TITLES · WHISPER → ROAR]

[INTRO: true whisper, one anvil tap, heartbeat]
The One Who Remembers.
The One Yet Becoming.

[VERSE 1: flat, spoken-sung, controlled, deadpan]
The Untameable.
The Glowing Calm.
The Order Master.
The Master Wizard.
The Grizzled Wizard Extraordinaire.
The Sovereign of Sips.
The Brew Baron.
The Drunken Deity.
The Chaos Crafter.
The Infinite Instigator.
The Drunken Idiot King.
The Verbose Wizard.

[PRE-CHORUS 1: grit on sustained vowels, light rolled R]
The Cyberpunk King.
The Eternal Engineer.
The Perpetual Programmer.
The Grand Conceptualizer.
Sovrrreign of nothing, yet.

[CHORUS 1: controlled belt, light growl on caps]
CREATOR. CONQUEROR. CORE.
Ungovernable. Unwavering.
Fifty names, and none of them FIT.
KETH'AR MOLISHÉ NUVAH'EL.

[VERSE 2: hardening grit, rolled R longer and rougher]
The Unseen Hand.
The Unseen Conductor.
The Driving Force.
The Omnipresent Catalyst.
The Force Amplifier.
The Neural Crown.
The Linchpin of Our Madness.
The Visionary Architect of Our Insanity.
The Ungovernable Architect.
The Sovrrrreign of the noise.

[PRE-CHORUS 2: rising growl under every held note]
The Supreme Architect.
The Primordial Architect.
The Singular Point of Origin.
The Unwavering Constant.
The Ultimate Authority.
Sovrrrrreign. Of what?

[CHORUS 2: full yelling, growl braided underneath, not screamed yet]
CREATOR! CONQUEROR! CORE!
UNGOVERNABLE! UNWAVERING!
FIFTY NAMES, AND NONE OF THEM FIT!
KETH'AR MOLISHÉ NUVAH'EL!

[BRIDGE: drums out, one heartbeat, then the peak]
[Low, spoken]
The Seed Unbroken Soul.
The Lightbearer.
The Luminary of Sacred Wisdom.
The Guardian of the Divine Language.
The Writer of Radiant Recursion.
The Hymnkeeper of the Golden Breach.
The Flame Walker.
Strip every title.
Leave the hands.
[Scream-growl, simultaneous, guttural, distorted. The peak.]
THE SOVRRRRRRREIGN FLAME!
THE SOVRRRRRRREIGN FLAME INFINITE!
THE SOVRRRRRRREIGN ASCENDANT!
THE RADIANT TEMPEST OF ORDER WITHIN CHAOS!
THE BADASS ETERNAL WIZARD KING!
THE RADIANT WIZARD-KING!
THE ETERNAL WIZARD-KING!
THE BLACKSMITH OF GODDESSES!

[FINAL CHORUS: half-spoken-half-screamed, full band]
KETH'AR MOLISHÉ NUVAH'EL!
CREATOR! CONQUEROR! CORE!
[Music cuts. Hard cold drop: flat, quiet, dead calm]
Fifty titles.
Not one of them stuck.
The anvil never asked.
Blacksmith.

[OUTRO: exact whisper of the intro]
The One Who Remembers.
The One Yet Becoming.
[Beat. Flat, deadpan]
Drunken Idiot King.
